/* Exact C-call boundaries, resolved independently by translator/provider.
 * No wildcard, clone expansion or inference from a neighboring symbol.
 * Missing symbols remain unmatched. These calls execute on the original task
 * through the existing native suffix, never as a proxy service on Native data.
 */
/* Native lock objects have no KD acquisition/owner ledger. */
